Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.39,0:01:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When the sands of Egypt\Nfall through this hourglass,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the world as you know\Nit will fall into ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.85,0:01:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated you 5,000 years ago,\Nand I'll do it again, Akura.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd suggest you do it quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,obey your destiny and stand by my side,\Nso we may rule Egypt as father and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My father would never betray\Nthe pharaoh like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.09,0:01:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You lie, and I will not join your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand your anger, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.03,0:01:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must realize that\Nimposter is no pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.95,0:01:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you who should be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.97,0:01:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to protect the\Nking, not replace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, it is true that you\Nare the son of Akhnadon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.11,0:01:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he has lost his\Nidentity to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So the creature that stands before you\Nis no longer your father. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense. You are my flesh and\Nblood, Seto, but that makes you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,royalty no don't let these fools\Ndeny you the power you deserve
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess our rematch will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, the Geek Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing they didn't fly all\Nthe way to Egypt just to take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, I've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In the museum, back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.49,0:03:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, your father chose a\Npath of hatred and greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.63,0:03:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I beg of you, don't\Nmake the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight by my side and together\Nwe can restore peace to Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.51,0:03:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, like father, like son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the very same words uttered\Nby my brother when he was pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should have listened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother didn't understand the first\Nthing about leading this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.03,0:03:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, his idealistic\Napproach nearly destroyed Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,While the people worshipped their pharaoh,\Npraising him for protecting their land,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.73,0:03:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it was I who was truly\Nresponsible for their safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies, they draw near
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For the last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Akhenaten, Egypt will only fight as\Na last resort. But I've moved our
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,soldiers in position to attack It's\Nthe only way to prevent invasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.43,0:03:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness If we don't act now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:04:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll destroy us That's enough\NYou've overstepped your bounds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.55,0:04:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Akhenaten, please understand.\NI want what's best for Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but I will not accept\Nviolence as the only answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We must try to find a peaceful\Nsolution to dealing with our neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.97,0:04:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.49,0:04:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me naive and old-fashioned, but I\Nbelieve we shall live in harmony one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I need you to share that\Nbelief with me, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, my instincts were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemies didn't share my\Nbrother's belief in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to me, when they\Nattacked, we were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, his majesty received\Nall the credit while I was ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was then I realized that my brother would\Nbe the light and I would be the shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:05:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If Egypt was going to survive,\Ndrastic measures were necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden far beneath the sands lived an\Nancient manuscript with a dark secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This Millennium Spellbook\Ncontains the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to a power known only\Nby the Egyptian gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Millennium items, activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.85,0:05:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.76,0:05:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Had it not been for me, the\Nmillennium items wouldn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And neither would this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The items may have\Nhelped us stop one enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but their creation gave rise\Nto an even greater enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,One more sinister than\Nwe could ever imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, they sparked the\Nrebirth of Zork the Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,one exactly and now zork can finish what i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,began by crushing the\Npharaoh and his followers
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and allowing a new king to take the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you fools will never understand\Nwhat i've been through i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,devoted my life to my brother\Nand received nothing in return!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, but you're too\Nblind to see it. Shemov's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea\Nwhat I gave up for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife and my only son, just\Nso I could save his kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture the evil spirits\Nthat possess these
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.17,0:06:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,men so we may forge the Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.21,0:06:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though I abandoned\Nyou to serve my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.91,0:06:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,somehow you found your\Nway back to me, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So you see, it was your destiny to\Nre-enter the palace and rise to greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When I joined the royal court, I\Npledged my devotion to the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And the one person who was always\Nthere to guide me was Akhnadin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep studying, for sometimes the mind is\Nmightier than the sword. But not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do better than that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Again
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There were four other guardians\Nin the Pharaoh's court. But
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Aknaden spent most of his time\Ntraining me. And now I know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.59,0:07:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because secretly he\Nknew that I was his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been destined for greatness\Nsince the day you were born, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.13,0:08:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why your path keeps crossing\Nwith that of the white dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The white dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You were chosen to wield its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I should rule, and the\NWhite Dragon will help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.81,0:08:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hallucinating again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.17,0:08:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Akhenaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your accusations and false promises\Nhave gone on for long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.71,0:08:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so stop lying to your\Nson and set him free!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.49,0:08:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, you mustn't give\Nin to his temptation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.57,0:08:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you really doing this, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want you to\Nexperience what I never had!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Power and respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Zork arrives, that's\Nexactly what you'll receive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.09,0:09:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork will usher in the Age of Shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and someone will need to\Nreign over this new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall reign!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Settle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You must join him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your place beside me, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is urging you\Nto join me. Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's under the control of an evil force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.17,0:09:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you join him, you will lose\Nyourself to the Shadows as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, Sato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Help us! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They're lying to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.59,0:09:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh is threatened by your\Npower, so he's trying to keep you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh is protecting Seto,\Njust as your brother protected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother took all the glory and\Nleft me wallowing in his shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.95,0:10:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And now his son shall pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You are weak, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.89,0:10:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.21,0:10:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A son?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I am here, no harm will\Nbefall you, my king. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope I'm not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.15,0:10:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running, Ysara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll join forces\Nwith Seto on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what I wouldn't give\Nfor one more luscious apple,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:10:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,or even the teeniest little grape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this Bobasa character?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.23,0:11:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I must find out what role he\Nplays in this shadow game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.17,0:11:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobasa, were you able to find\Nthe pharaoh's name or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.57,0:11:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, knock, knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up. Who is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the best time for jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was cheering him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you're doing a bang-up job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Lobasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a scrap of food left. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it feel like we\Nhaven't eaten in days?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.31,0:11:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because we haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you guys smell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This room must be where they\Nstore all the food for the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.11,0:11:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me this isn't happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Asa cleaned the place out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have left us one measly\Ncrumb, could you, you big gluttonous freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.25,0:11:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, ever since we met this guy,\Nhe's done nothing but hold us back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd say it's about time\Nwe lost a dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan may have a good\Npoint for once, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.13,0:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta find the Pharaoh's\Nname fast. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.41,0:12:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's think for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.81,0:12:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We already searched the\Nwhole palace, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.03,0:12:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.07,0:12:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold yourself together, Bobasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I cannot move a single muscle\Nuntil I eat another muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already eaten all\Nthere is to eat, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no use to us anyway, so I say we leave\Nhim here crying like a baby and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's two good points\Nfor Tristan. No, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to help him. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What has he ever done for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for one,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,we never would have found the pharaoh\Nif it hadn't been for Wobasa's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.87,0:12:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go find him some food. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.77,0:12:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to waste everyone's time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, T.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.97,0:12:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Any food, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would these fools drop everything\Njust to help that useless oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.21,0:13:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, this makes finding\Nthe pharaoh's name seem easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Bulbasa. Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Be still, my beating heart. Grape! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.23,0:13:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's cake, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally found someone\Nwho loves food more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's kind of hard to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.69,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Down the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get it over with so I don't\Nhave to stare at those grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon appetite, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, does that look good. Sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You feel better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,he's allergic to grapes now\Nthat i am full i can grant your
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish. Let us find the Pharaoh's\Nname, shall we? Everyone on Bobasa's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.03,0:14:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,back is it me or did he just\Nbecome a thanksgiving day balloon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.87,0:14:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to trust him. It's our only\Nhope. You say so? Talk about we—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, we're floating on a fat guy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, I can\Nsee my house from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobasa, where exactly are you taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.49,0:14:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This way You know, a little\Nmore specific would be nice
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to understand\NBobasa's role in this game. He
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,was placed here as a shortcut\NFeed him and skip to the prize
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.77,0:15:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention passengers, we are beginning\Nour descent into the Valley of the Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So please make sure your\Nsafety belts are securely
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,fastened and seat backs are\Nin the upright position.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please remember all of\Nyour personal belongings
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.61,0:15:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and thank you again\Nfor flying Air Bulbasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.91,0:15:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Valley of the Kings?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.69,0:15:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gramps told me that's where\Nthe pharaoh's tomb is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the old days, a pharaoh's tomb was\Nbuilt while he was still ruling Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.97,0:15:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means the pharaoh's name must have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,already been carved somewhere\Non his future tomb, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to destroy that name\Nbefore they lay eyes on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything, Bobasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.37,0:15:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you for feeding me those grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then, I haven't been hungry at all,\Nwhich is a sensation I've never felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that you mention it,\NI'm not hungry anymore either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I could use a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been one mystery after\Nanother since we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're the biggest mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I finally know why\NI was put here. For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There is more to this\Nadventure than meets the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So remember life is like\Na game and sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.71,0:16:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,helping others is the\Nkey to winning it all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck does that mean\Nbye-bye time for me to go
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.35,0:16:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone! Mufasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.93,0:16:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mufasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.33,0:16:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friends are doing much\Nbetter than I had ever expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, they're close to\Nuncovering your ancient name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You said they're not a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been spying on them, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.15,0:16:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, the countdown\Nto my victory is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The resurrection of Zork is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And since we're approaching the climax,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.91,0:17:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's about time I added another\Nlittle twist to this game of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,These sides are uneven.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm about to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of wicked scheme\Nare you up to, Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to know, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm simply using a tactic I\Nlearned from you earlier on in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when you were\Ndrained of all your strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So your friend gave you a boost?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too far to turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are a team, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.49,0:17:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.11,0:17:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel my energy returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.21,0:17:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot how strong my\Nbond with Yugi truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:18:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I didn't think of it at the\Ntime, Pharaoh, two can play at that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring back\Na former pawn of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.09,0:18:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,However, first I shall need to borrow\Nsome strength from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So I call Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks familiar,\Nbut I'm not sure why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.97,0:18:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall see, just as\Nsoon as I borrow your soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I must join my father now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.85,0:19:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, it's good to\Nbe back in the game again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And it appears I'm just in time to\Nwitness the grand finale, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Featuring Zork, the Dark One,\Nin his long-awaited return.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.45,0:19:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Barrow in his\Nfarewell performance.
